          "text": "To count; to tell by numbers; to count over, or tell off one after another; to number; to reckon up; to mention one by one; to name over; to make a special and separate account of; to recount; as, to enumerate the stars in a constellation. Enumerating the services he had done. Ludlow. recapitulate; detail.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        }
      ],
